B.VI={chart:0,cellarbook:1,ovenlog:2,extension:3,watch:4,clock:5,boots:6,phone:7,souffle:8,ricotta:9,flakes:10,rack:11,pinboiler:12,pinpantry:13,ledger:14,notice:15,receipt:16,regiment:17,scoresheet:18,decanter:19,notepad:20,planner:21,prints:22}
B.Uw=new A.aQ(B.VI,["Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.h,u.p,u.X,u.Q,u.Q,u.o,u.B,u.N,"Not hers, you say. Then ask the one dessert who knows every filling in this house: the housekeeper.","Fried, not baked. Penny does all the cooking here. She would know who under this roof ever saw a frying pan.","To take that pin, somebody walked straight through Penny's kitchen while she was in it. Ask her what she noticed. And what she didn't.",u.d,u.d,u.L,u.L,"Chocolate medals! A man might do a great deal to keep that quiet. Still, shame is a reason. It is not proof.","No such colonel! A man might do a great deal to keep that quiet. Still, shame is a reason. It is not proof.","A meticulous chap, Graham. So why is there a gap in a record like that? Ask the two who sat at that board.","Undisturbed since Christmas. Remember that, the next time somebody tells you where they went for a drink.","An appointment, and kept. Dull, but dull is useful: it tells us where two of them meant to be.","No more extensions, whatever he says. Her own hand, this very week. Has anyone shown you something that says otherwise?","A print tells you who touched it, not when. And where it sits tells you how the thing was held. Two of those three have a reason to have touched it. Ask all three."],t.l)
B.Pp=s(["Before you name anyone, Churlock: do we know the very minute she died? Find that, and then find where each of the five was at that minute.","Four of them were somewhere they can prove. Go over the telephone log, the muddy boots and the souffl\xe9 once more. Whose story rests on nothing but another dessert's word?","Look at what was left beside the body, and at what the weapon tells you once it is dusted. Then ask Penny who it could belong to.","The chess game, old chap. Two players, but did both of them stay in the room? Ask each what the other did at a quarter to eleven. And read that note about the debt very carefully indeed."],t.s)
B.b3={}
