B.JX=new A.N("prints","Prints on the Hatpin","",0,"One set of prints came up under the powder, and only one: Tira Misu's, on the pearl head. It is her hatpin, so that by itself is no more than one would expect. But nobody else has ever held it.",B.bd,B.ba,null,B.i,B.c,!1,"churlock")
